{
  "format": "eidos-gameplay-plugin",
  "version": 1,
  "id": "chinese-room",
  "name": "文字地图与角色扮演",
  "release": "0.4.1",
  "stateVersion": 1,
  "description": "在文字地图中走动、交谈、调查和前往其他地点。AI 可通过文件工具读取与更新布局，随剧情播放采用地图，沿用原有对话、背包、任务与存档。",
  "tags": [
    "文字地图",
    "角色扮演",
    "人物互动",
    "地点探索"
  ],
  "prompts": {
    "creation": "当前主世界将使用文字地图操作。沿用正常世界结构、NPC、物品、目标与地点连接，设计适合亲自走动、当面交谈和调查的日常空间。每处场景给出清楚的入口、可见人物和可调查对象。不设计短局肉鸽、行动点或单向闯关。",
    "action": "玩家正在同一主世界的文字地图中操作，地图按钮产生的行动与玩家打字拥有相同效力。人物反应、物品增减、目标、时间、场景切换仍按正常世界更新。RPG 文案围绕眼前可感知对象：NPC每次回应当前问题并记住承诺；调查给出具体所见和可验证线索；取物、使用、交付体现物品去向与后续反应；回访体现此前选择。每段简洁自然，重要对话逐步展开，availableActions 提供少量具体可做的交谈、调查、帮助、使用物品或继续探索。通过地图出口请求前往地点时检查当前真实连接与阻挡条件。探索发现新地点时按正常 mapUpdates 公开地点和通路，主世界地图将据此增加出口。不要让NPC一次说尽所有信息，也不要替玩家决定。普通格内走路不推进时间、不调用叙事或生成世界线节点。 地图可以使用现有文件和命令输出流：目录 maps/<插件ID>/current.json 是当前公开场景 scene、布局 map 和坐标 player 的只读资料，需要空间信息时按真实路径/version 调用 files.read；不需要每轮读取，不把坐标或工具命令写入对白。日常交谈、普通走路不重画地图；只有开门、环境变化、布置物件或新地点确需表达时，按已有布局局部修改，保留地标、门和主角可站立位置。地图源文件不可覆写，可用 files.write/patch 在本轮 draftRoot 制作草稿，再通过正常 documents 发布：key 为 scene_map 或 scene_map_加字母数字后缀，format:text，content 为完整 JSON（或 artifactRef 指向实际草稿 path/version），segmentIndex 绑定环境变化发生的段落。无需在故事中展示文件链接或写制作说明。JSON 使用 {format:\"eidos-scene-map\",version:1,sceneId:真实地点ID,tiles:{单字:{name,walkable:boolean}},rows:[等宽地图行],entry:{x,y},entities:[{id,kind:\"npc\"|\"exit\"|\"object\"|\"action\",ref,name,glyph:单字,x,y}]}；沿用已读原图格式。npc/exit/object 引用当前公开 scene.npcs/exits/objects 的 id，action 引用真实 availableActions 原文。必须包含全部公开人物和出口；实体、入口互不重叠，主角位置仍可走，所有交互对象从入口可接近。没有可靠空间资料时沿用当前地图，不凭空捏造新 NPC 或通路。若确需新地点或人物，先通过主游戏正常状态协议公开；地图文件不能授予物品、开锁、移动 NPC 或改变世界事实。文件在行动接受且相应段落播放后才可采用，工具暂存成功不等于地图已生效。下一次需要修改时读取目录中的当前投影，或已生成地图文件，不重复输出无变化地图。",
    "review": "文字地图只是主世界的操控呈现层，不拥有另一套背包、人物、任务或事件结果。核对真实场景连接、人物记忆与可知范围、物品去向、承诺和行动后果；新通路沿用现有地图更新协议，不通过舞台状态直接改写世界。 地图文件仅是当前分支的空间表现，检查实体引用和真实通路；不以 JSON 中的门或人物代替主世界状态更新。正常交谈没有地图产物是合理的。"
  },
  "rules": [],
  "ui": {
    "reading": "inherit",
    "initialState": {},
    "presentation": "scene-map",
    "html": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"zh-CN\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><style>\n:root{color-scheme:light;--paper:var(--eidos-paper,#fafafa);--ink:var(--eidos-ink,#191919);--accent:var(--eidos-accent,#9e0000);--font:var(--font-geist-sans,ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif)}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body,main{width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;overflow:hidden}body{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font:1rem var(--font)}main{display:grid;place-items:center;padding:clamp(4px,1vw,14px);outline:none;touch-action:manipulation}#board{display:grid;max-width:100%;max-height:100%;user-select:none;outline:none;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink) 3%,var(--paper))}button{appearance:none;aspect-ratio:1;padding:0;border:0;border-radius:1px;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);font:500 var(--map-glyph-size,1.25rem)/1 var(--font);min-width:0;min-height:0;position:relative;cursor:pointer}button:focus-visible{outline:1px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:-1px;z-index:1}.ground{color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink) 28%,var(--paper))}.terrain{font-size:calc(var(--map-glyph-size,1.25rem) * .82);color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink) 45%,var(--paper));background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink) 4%,var(--paper))}.npc{color:var(--accent)}.exit{box-shadow:inset 0 -1px color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink) 25%,var(--paper))}.exit[data-blocked=\"true\"]{opacity:.45;box-shadow:inset 0 -1px currentColor}.near{box-shadow:inset 0 -2px color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 60%,transparent)}.player{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}.player:after{content:\"\";position:absolute;background:var(--accent);width:4px;height:4px;left:calc(50% - 2px);bottom:1px}.player[data-facing=\"up\"]:after{top:1px;bottom:auto}.player[data-facing=\"left\"]:after{left:1px;top:calc(50% - 2px);bottom:auto}.player[data-facing=\"right\"]:after{right:1px;left:auto;top:calc(50% - 2px);bottom:auto}#board[aria-busy=\"true\"]{outline:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--accent) 25%,transparent)}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{scroll-behavior:auto}}\n</style></head><body><main id=\"map-surface\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"地点地图，方向键移动，确认键交互\"><div id=\"board\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"文字地图\"></div></main><script>/* Layouts describe presentation only. All actionable references belong to the host world. */\nglobalThis.ChineseRoom = (() => {\n  const fail = message => { throw new Error(message); };\n  const clone = value => JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(value));\n  const chars = text => Array.from(text ?? '');\n  const key = (x, y) => `${x},${y}`;\n  const steps = [[0, -1], [1, 0], [0, 1], [-1, 0]];\n  const object = value => !!value && typeof value === 'object' && !Array.isArray(value);\n  const text = value => typeof value === 'string' && !!value.trim();\n  const parseJSON = value => typeof value === 'string' ? JSON.parse(value.trim().replace(/^```(?:json)?\\s*/i, '').replace(/\\s*```$/, '')) : value;\n  const walkable = (map, x, y) => map.tiles[chars(map.rows[y])[x]]?.walkable === true;\n  function binding(entity, scene) {\n    if (entity.kind === 'npc') return scene.npcs.find(n => n.id === entity.ref);\n    if (entity.kind === 'exit') return scene.exits.find(e => e.id === entity.ref);\n    if (entity.kind === 'object') return scene.objects.find(o => o.id === entity.ref);\n    if (entity.kind === 'action' && scene.actions.includes(entity.ref)) return { id: entity.ref, name: entity.name };\n    return null;\n  }\n  function reachable(map, origin, target) {\n    const queue = [[origin.x, origin.y, []]], seen = new Set([key(origin.x, origin.y)]);\n    const occupied = new Set(map.entities.map(e => key(e.x, e.y)));\n    for (let i = 0; i < queue.length; i++) {\n      const [x, y, route] = queue[i];\n      if (target.entity ? Math.abs(x - target.x) + Math.abs(y - target.y) === 1 : x === target.x && y === target.y) return route;\n      for (const [dx, dy] of steps) {\n        const nx = x + dx, ny = y + dy, k = key(nx, ny);\n        if (!seen.has(k) && !occupied.has(k) && walkable(map, nx, ny)) { seen.add(k); queue.push([nx, ny, [...route, [dx, dy]]]); }\n      }\n    }\n    return null;\n  }\n  function validateMap(input, scene, player) {\n    const map = clone(parseJSON(input));\n    if (!object(map) || map.format !== 'eidos-scene-map' || map.version !== 1 || map.sceneId !== scene.id) fail('地图不属于当前地点');\n    if (!object(map.tiles) || Object.entries(map.tiles).some(([g, t]) => chars(g).length !== 1 || !object(t) || !text(t.name) || typeof t.walkable !== 'boolean' || ['__proto__', 'constructor', 'prototype'].includes(g))) fail('地形定义无效');\n    const width = chars(map.rows?.[0]).length;\n    if (!Array.isArray(map.rows) || !map.rows.length || !width || map.rows.some(row => typeof row !== 'string' || chars(row).length !== width || chars(row).some(g => !Object.hasOwn(map.tiles, g)))) fail('地图行须等宽并使用已声明地形');\n    if (!object(map.entry) || !Number.isInteger(map.entry.x) || !Number.isInteger(map.entry.y) || !walkable(map, map.entry.x, map.entry.y)) fail('地图入口无效');\n    if (!Array.isArray(map.entities) || new Set(map.entities.map(e => e?.id)).size !== map.entities.length) fail('地图对象 ID 重复或无效');\n    const occupied = new Set(), refs = new Set();\n    for (const e of map.entities) {\n      if (!object(e) || !text(e.id) || !text(e.name) || chars(e.glyph).length !== 1 || !Number.isInteger(e.x) || !Number.isInteger(e.y) || !walkable(map, e.x, e.y)) fail('地图对象无效');\n      const bound = binding(e, scene); if (!bound) fail('地图引用了当前世界不存在的人物、出口或行动');\n      if (e.kind !== 'action') e.name = bound.name;\n      const p = key(e.x, e.y), ref = `${e.kind}:${e.ref}`;\n      if (occupied.has(p) || refs.has(ref) || p === key(map.entry.x, map.entry.y)) fail('地图对象重叠');\n      occupied.add(p); refs.add(ref);\n    }\n    for (const npc of scene.npcs) if (!refs.has(`npc:${npc.id}`)) fail('地图遗漏当前人物');\n    for (const exit of scene.exits) if (!refs.has(`exit:${exit.id}`)) fail('地图遗漏当前出口');\n    if (map.entities.some(e => !reachable(map, map.entry, { ...e, entity: true }))) fail('地图有无法接近的人物或出口');\n    if (player && (!walkable(map, player.x, player.y) || occupied.has(key(player.x, player.y)) || !reachable(map, map.entry, player))) fail('新地图挡住了主角当前位置');\n    // Drop arbitrary fields: a visual map cannot carry inventory, quests or world-state commands.\n    return { format: map.format, version: 1, sceneId: scene.id, tiles: map.tiles, rows: map.rows, entry: map.entry,\n      entities: map.entities.map(e => ({ id: e.id, kind: e.kind, ref: e.ref, name: e.name, glyph: e.glyph, x: e.x, y: e.y })) };\n  }\n  return { fail, clone, chars, key, steps, walkable, binding, reachable, validateMap, parseJSON };\n})();\n</script><script>Object.assign(ChineseRoom, (() => {\n  const G = ChineseRoom;\n  const glyph = name => {\n    const letters = G.chars(name).filter(g => /[\\p{L}\\p{N}]/u.test(g));\n    return letters[0] === '阿' ? letters.at(-1) : letters.length > 3 ? letters.at(-2) : letters.at(-1) ?? '物';\n  };\n  function baseMap(scene) {\n    const refs = [...scene.npcs.map(n => ({ ...n, kind: 'npc' })), ...scene.exits.map(e => ({ ...e, kind: 'exit' })), ...scene.objects.map(o => ({ ...o, kind: 'object' }))];\n    const indoor = /屋|室|房|店|工坊|车厢|办公室|大厅|客厅|书房/.test(scene.name) || /屋内|室内|房间里|房间内/.test(scene.description);\n    const water = /河|湖|海|岸|港|渡|桥/.test(scene.name), forest = /林|山|园|田|村/.test(scene.name);\n    const ground = indoor ? '板' : forest ? '草' : '石', border = indoor ? '墙' : water ? '水' : forest ? '树' : '屋';\n    const width = 15, height = Math.max(9, 5 + Math.ceil(refs.length / 5) * 2);\n    const cells = Array.from({ length: height }, (_, y) => Array.from({ length: width }, (_, x) => x === 0 || y === 0 || x === width - 1 || y === height - 1 ? border : ground));\n    if (!indoor) {\n      for (let y = 1; y < height - 1; y++) { const x = water ? 6 + (y > height / 2 ? 1 : 0) : 7; cells[y][x] = '路'; cells[y][x + 1] = '路'; }\n      for (let x = 1; x < width - 1; x++) cells[Math.floor(height / 2)][x] = '路';\n    }\n    if (water) for (let y = 2; y < height - 2; y++) for (let x = 1; x <= (y % 3 === 0 ? 2 : 1); x++) cells[y][x] = border;\n    const map = { format: 'eidos-scene-map', version: 1, sceneId: scene.id,\n      tiles: { [ground]: { name: indoor ? '地板' : forest ? '草地' : '广场地面', walkable: true }, [border]: { name: indoor ? '墙壁' : water ? '水面' : forest ? '树丛' : '街边建筑', walkable: false }, ...(!indoor ? { 路: { name: '道路', walkable: true } } : {}) },\n      rows: [], entry: { x: 7, y: height - 2 }, entities: [] };\n    const occupied = new Set([G.key(map.entry.x, map.entry.y)]);\n    const edges = [[7, 0], [14, Math.floor(height / 2)], [7, height - 1], [0, Math.floor(height / 2)], [3, 0], [11, 0]];\n    for (let y = 1; y < height - 1; y++) edges.push([0, y], [14, y]);\n    for (let x = 1; x < width - 1; x++) edges.push([x, 0], [x, height - 1]);\n    const spaces = [[4, 3], [10, 5], [6, height - 3], [11, 2], [3, height - 3], [8, 4]];\n    for (let y = 2; y < height - 1; y += 2) for (let x = 2; x < width - 1; x += 2) spaces.push([x, y]);\n    let slot = 0;\n    // Doors belong to boundaries; people belong to walkable activity zones rather than a menu row.\n    for (const ref of [...refs.filter(r => r.kind === 'exit'), ...refs.filter(r => r.kind !== 'exit')]) {\n      const candidates = ref.kind === 'exit' ? [...edges, ...spaces] : spaces;\n      const cell = candidates.find(([x, y]) => !occupied.has(G.key(x, y)) && (ref.kind === 'exit' || map.tiles[cells[y][x]].walkable));\n      if (!cell) G.fail('当前地点缺少足够的活动空间');\n      const [x, y] = cell; occupied.add(G.key(x, y)); if (ref.kind === 'exit') cells[y][x] = ground;\n      map.entities.push({ id: `entity-${++slot}`, kind: ref.kind, ref: ref.id, name: ref.name, glyph: glyph(ref.name), x, y });\n    }\n    map.rows = cells.map(row => row.join(''));\n    return G.validateMap(map, scene);\n  }\n  function reconcile(map, scene, position) {\n    try {\n      const next = G.clone(map); next.entities = next.entities.filter(e => G.binding(e, scene)).map(e => e.kind === 'action' ? e : { ...e, name: G.binding(e, scene).name });\n      const required = [...scene.npcs.map(n => ({ ...n, kind: 'npc' })), ...scene.exits.map(e => ({ ...e, kind: 'exit' })), ...scene.objects.map(o => ({ ...o, kind: 'object' }))];\n      const occupied = new Set(next.entities.map(e => G.key(e.x, e.y))); occupied.add(G.key(next.entry.x, next.entry.y)); if (position) occupied.add(G.key(position.x, position.y));\n      for (const ref of required) {\n        if (next.entities.some(e => e.kind === ref.kind && e.ref === ref.id)) continue;\n        let found = false;\n        for (let y = 1; y < next.rows.length - 1 && !found; y++) for (let x = 1; x < G.chars(next.rows[y]).length - 1 && !found; x++) {\n          if (occupied.has(G.key(x, y)) || !G.walkable(next, x, y)) continue;\n          const e = { id: `added-${ref.kind}-${ref.id}`, kind: ref.kind, ref: ref.id, name: ref.name, glyph: glyph(ref.name), x, y };\n          next.entities.push(e);\n          try { G.validateMap(next, { ...scene, npcs: scene.npcs.filter(n => next.entities.some(e => e.kind === 'npc' && e.ref === n.id)), exits: scene.exits.filter(n => next.entities.some(e => e.kind === 'exit' && e.ref === n.id)) }, position); occupied.add(G.key(x, y)); found = true; }\n          catch { next.entities.pop(); }\n        }\n        if (!found) return baseMap(scene);\n      }\n      return G.validateMap(next, scene, position);\n    } catch { return baseMap(scene); }\n  }\n  const near = (map, p) => map.entities.filter(e => Math.abs(e.x - p.x) + Math.abs(e.y - p.y) === 1);\n  function move(map, input, dx, dy) {\n    if (!G.steps.some(s => s[0] === dx && s[1] === dy)) G.fail('移动方向无效');\n    const p = { ...input, facing: [dx, dy] }, x = p.x + dx, y = p.y + dy;\n    if (!G.walkable(map, x, y)) return { position: p };\n    const entity = map.entities.find(e => e.x === x && e.y === y);\n    return entity ? { position: p, entity } : { position: { ...p, x, y } };\n  }\n  function intent(entity) {\n    return { kind: { npc: 'talk', exit: 'travel', object: 'inspect', action: 'action' }[entity.kind], targetId: entity.ref };\n  }\n  const positionFor = (map, saved) => saved && G.walkable(map, saved.x, saved.y) && !map.entities.some(e => e.x === saved.x && e.y === saved.y) ? { ...G.clone(saved), facing: G.steps.some(s => s[0] === saved.facing?.[0] && s[1] === saved.facing?.[1]) ? saved.facing : [0, -1] } : { ...map.entry, facing: [0, -1] };\n  function viewport(map, position, limit = { width: 17, height: 11 }) {\n    const width = Math.min(limit.width, G.chars(map.rows[0]).length), height = Math.min(limit.height, map.rows.length);\n    return { width, height, x: Math.max(0, Math.min(G.chars(map.rows[0]).length - width, position.x - Math.floor(width / 2))), y: Math.max(0, Math.min(map.rows.length - height, position.y - Math.floor(height / 2))) };\n  }\n  function layoutViewport(map, position, frame) {\n    const width = Math.max(1, frame.width), height = Math.max(1, frame.height);\n    const scale = Math.max(0.7, Math.min(3, frame.fontSize / 14));\n    const view = viewport(map, position, { width: Math.max(1, Math.min(17, Math.floor(width / (32 * scale)))), height: Math.max(1, Math.min(11, Math.floor(height / (32 * scale)))) });\n    const cellSize = Math.min(width / view.width, height / view.height, 38 * scale);\n    return { view, cellSize, glyphSize: cellSize * 0.68 };\n  }\n  function arrival(map, from) {\n    const exit = map.entities.find(e => e.kind === 'exit' && e.ref === from);\n    if (exit) for (const [dx, dy] of G.steps) {\n      const x = exit.x + dx, y = exit.y + dy;\n      if (G.walkable(map, x, y) && !map.entities.some(e => e.x === x && e.y === y) && G.reachable(map, map.entry, { x, y })) return { x, y, facing: [dx, dy] };\n    }\n    return positionFor(map);\n  }\n  return { viewport, layoutViewport, arrival, baseMap, reconcile, near, move, intent, positionFor };\n})());\n</script><script>/* Project-specific synthesis; source references are recorded in map-design.md. */\nChineseRoom.mapDesignGuide = `先设计空间，再填写地形。文字是像素素材的替代，不是把地点名排列成菜单。\n1. 明确这个地点是做什么的：店铺、住宅、广场、河岸、树林各有不同形状和使用动线。先确定入口、可见地标、主要活动区、出口，再连接道路。\n2. 以角色一格为尺度。主路尽量两格宽，交谈对象前留出停步空间；不要把 NPC 排成横排或放进只剩一个格子的死角。\n3. 一个画面有一个容易辨认的中心：井、树、柜台、桥或广场。让视线和行走路径自然到达它，支路通向确实有内容的对象。\n4. 草地、泥土和室内地板作为留白底色；树、墙、家具和水域成片构成形状，不把每一格都填成醒目的字。装饰沿有意义的地形聚集，留出走路的空间。\n5. 自然地形有转折和疏密变化，人工建筑有清楚的轮廓与门；根据现有描述表达地貌，不凭空改变世界设定。房屋不全是空盒，野外不全是矩形围墙。\n6. 出口放在相应边缘、街口或建筑门上，连接真实目的地。北侧道路与南侧道路在位置上有区分；返回同一地点时保持门和地标位置稳定。\n7. 人物站在有理由的位置：店主靠柜台、守门人靠门、园丁在花圃边。使用人物名字中可辨认的单字；每个图标仍绑定真实人物 ID。\n8. 由地面、阻挡地形、交互实体分层表达空间。装饰不参与物品奖励；可互动对象引用现有 NPC、线索、动作和出口，不新建一套任务或背包。\n9. 先检查入口可达、道路连续、没有孤岛，且人物和出口能走到相邻格。对主角当前位置作同样检查。不要靠任意传送补救坏地图。\n10. 玩家探索、对话、调查后才触发真实事件。走格子不是消耗行动次数的回合；普通阻挡只停止移动，面向人物按确认键交互。\n11. 小房间一屏可读；城镇、河岸等可比一屏更大，镜头随主角移动。不要通过缩小所有字来容纳大地图，避免空旷的超大场景。\n12. 回访与更新保留已确认结构，按新的公开剧情调整物件与局部环境。最终自查：能否一眼看懂道路、主要地标、人物位置和离开的方向？`;\n</script><script>Object.assign(ChineseRoom, {\n  generationTask: `为现有 RPG 当前地点绘制一张可走动的文字地图。只返回 JSON，不写故事、不执行行动、不创设另一套世界状态。\n格式 {format:\"eidos-scene-map\",version:1,sceneId:材料当前地点ID,tiles:{单字:{name,walkable:boolean}},rows:[等宽文字地图行],entry:{x,y},entities:[{id,kind:\"npc\"|\"exit\"|\"object\"|\"action\",ref:宿主已有引用,name,glyph:单字,x,y}]}。\n优先 按用途确定尺寸：小房间约 13–19 列、9–13 行；街区或室外可约 21–33 列、13–23 行，相机只显示附近一屏，文字应体现当前地点的空间：室内的门、桌边、走廊；室外的树、河岸、桥、草地等。地形与图标按当前世界自定义，留出足够空白，不要写满字。不采用战斗棋盘、肉鸽路线或节点计数。地形可以单字定义为可走或不可走。\n实体 npc 必须引用 scene.npcs[].id，exit 引用 scene.exits[].id，object 引用 scene.objects[].id，action 引用 scene.actions 中一条完整原文。必须包含全部当前人物和出口；物件可选。其他视觉细节用地形表示，不能凭空新增可交互人物、物品、任务或场景。\n坐标从零起；实体及入口须在可走格，互不重叠，所有实体可从入口走到相邻格。不把 NPC 当成可穿过的地形。更新已有地图时尽量保留建筑与门的位置，根据新的已读剧情表达环境变化；保留 player 坐标可走且不与实体重叠。阻挡的出口仍可表示，但不能在地图里解锁，宿主会检查是否可通行。\n不返回背包、对话选择、物品奖励、任务、事件效果、世界标记等字段；这些由现有主叙事系统处理。地图只是当前主世界的操控画面。`,\n  generationMaterial(context, map, player, theme) {\n    return JSON.stringify({ scene: context.scene, visibleProse: context.reading?.segments?.map(segment => ({ type: segment.type, speaker: segment.speaker, text: segment.text })).slice(-8), worldName: context.world?.name, player, previousMap: map, designGuide: ChineseRoom.mapDesignGuide, visualStyle: theme || '简洁、留白、和当前场景一致', example: ChineseRoom.baseMap(context.scene) });\n  },\n});\n</script><script>Object.assign(ChineseRoom, {\n  renderView({ context, map, position, generating }, handlers) {\n    const G = ChineseRoom, board = document.getElementById('board');\n    if (!map || !position) { board.replaceChildren(); return; }\n    const existing = new Map([...board.children].map(cell => [cell.dataset.cell, cell]));\n    const focused = document.activeElement?.closest?.('[data-cell]')?.dataset.cell, visible = new Set();\n    let index = 0;\n    const style = getComputedStyle(document.getElementById('map-surface')), root = getComputedStyle(document.documentElement);\n    const padding = name => parseFloat(style[name]) || 8;\n    const { view, cellSize, glyphSize } = G.layoutViewport(map, position, { width: window.innerWidth - padding('paddingLeft') - padding('paddingRight'), height: window.innerHeight - padding('paddingTop') - padding('paddingBottom'), fontSize: parseFloat(root.fontSize) || 16 });\n    const disabled = handlers.locked(), near = G.near(map, position);\n    board.setAttribute('aria-label', `${context.world?.sceneName ?? '当前地点'}文字地图`); board.setAttribute('aria-busy', String(generating));\n    board.style.gridTemplateColumns = `repeat(${view.width},minmax(0,1fr))`;\n    board.style.gridTemplateRows = `repeat(${view.height},minmax(0,1fr))`;\n    board.style.width = `${view.width * cellSize}px`; board.style.height = `${view.height * cellSize}px`;\n    board.style.setProperty('--map-glyph-size', `${glyphSize}px`);\n    const counts = {}; for (const g of G.chars(map.rows.join(''))) if (map.tiles[g].walkable) counts[g] = (counts[g] ?? 0) + 1;\n    const ground = Object.keys(counts).sort((a, b) => counts[b] - counts[a])[0];\n    for (let y = view.y; y < view.y + view.height; y++) for (let x = view.x; x < view.x + view.width; x++) {\n      const glyph = G.chars(map.rows[y])[x], tile = map.tiles[glyph], entity = map.entities.find(e => e.x === x && e.y === y), player = position.x === x && position.y === y;\n      const cell = G.key(x, y), b = existing.get(cell) ?? document.createElement('button');\n      visible.add(cell); b.type = 'button'; b.tabIndex = entity ? 0 : -1;\n      delete b.dataset.player; delete b.dataset.facing; delete b.dataset.blocked;\n      b.title = player ? '我' : entity?.name ?? tile.name;\n      b.textContent = player ? '我' : entity?.glyph ?? (glyph === ground ? ' ' : glyph);\n      b.className = player ? 'player' : entity ? entity.kind : tile.walkable ? 'ground' : 'terrain';\n      if (entity?.kind === 'exit' && context.scene?.exits.find(exit => exit.id === entity.ref)?.blocked) { b.dataset.blocked = 'true'; b.title = `${entity.name}（暂不可通行）`; }\n      if (entity && near.some(e => e.id === entity.id)) b.classList.add('near');\n      if (player) { b.dataset.player = 'true'; const [dx, dy] = position.facing; b.dataset.facing = dx > 0 ? 'right' : dx < 0 ? 'left' : dy < 0 ? 'up' : 'down'; }\n      b.dataset.cell = cell; b.setAttribute('aria-label', `${b.title}，${x}列${y}行`);\n      b.disabled = disabled || player || !tile.walkable;\n      b.onclick = () => { void handlers.goTo(x, y, entity); };\n      if (board.children[index] !== b) board.insertBefore(b, board.children[index] ?? null);\n      index++;\n    }\n    for (const cell of [...board.children]) if (!visible.has(cell.dataset.cell)) cell.remove();\n    if (focused) {\n      const cell = [...board.children].find(cell => cell.dataset.cell === focused);\n      if (cell && !cell.disabled && document.activeElement !== cell) cell.focus({ preventScroll: true });\n    }\n  },\n});\n</script><script>/* Only a map lives here. Dialogue, inventory, menus, outcomes and errors belong to the host. */\n(() => {\n  const G = ChineseRoom;\n  let context, map = null, position = null, busy = false, generating = false;\n  let walkEpoch = 0, generationEpoch = 0, attempted = new Set(), lastMove = 0, arrival = null;\n  let local = { maps: {}, positions: {} }, publicScene = null;\n  let fileEpoch = 0, filePending = false, fileScan = '';\n  const fileCache = new Map(), fileScenes = new Map(), invalidFiles = new Set();\n  const unavailable = () => !context || context.surface?.active === false || context.reading?.loading || context.reading?.paused || !context.reading?.complete && !context.reading?.error;\n  const locked = () => busy || unavailable() || context?.reading?.inputBlocked;\n  const render = () => G.renderView({ context: context ? { ...context, scene: context.scene ?? publicScene } : context, map, position, generating }, { locked, goTo });\n  const state = () => ({ ...context.state, maps: local.maps, positions: local.positions });\n  const notice = message => { void Eidos.world.notice(message).catch(error => console.warn('地图提示未能显示', error)); };\n  const signature = scene => JSON.stringify([scene.id, scene.npcs, scene.exits, scene.objects, context.settings?.map_style ?? '']);\n  const attemptKeyFor = scene => JSON.stringify([context.world?.id, signature(scene)]);\n  const attemptKey = () => attemptKeyFor(context.scene);\n  function save() { Eidos.setState(state()); }\n  function syncPosition(next) {\n    position = next; local.positions[map.sceneId] = next;\n    // Once the player has acted spatially, a replacement must preserve that position.\n    const { placeholder: _placeholder, entryFrom: _entryFrom, ...saved } = local.maps[map.sceneId] ?? {};\n    local.maps[map.sceneId] = saved; save(); render();\n  }\n  function cancelGeneration() {\n    if (!generating) return;\n    generationEpoch++; generating = false;\n    void Eidos.resources.cancel().catch(error => console.warn('旧地图绘制停止失败', error));\n  }\n  async function interact(entity) {\n    if (locked() || !map || !G.near(map, position).some(e => e.id === entity.id)) return;\n    walkEpoch++; cancelGeneration(); busy = true; render();\n    const intent = G.intent(entity);\n    if (intent.kind === 'travel' && context.scene?.exits.find(exit => exit.id === entity.ref)?.blocked) {\n      busy = false; notice('这条通路目前无法通过。'); render(); return;\n    }\n    if (intent.kind === 'travel') arrival = { from: map.sceneId, to: entity.ref, nodeId: context.world?.nodeId };\n    try { await Eidos.world.interact(intent, state()); }\n    catch (error) { arrival = null; notice(error.message); }\n    finally { busy = false; render(); maybeGenerate(); }\n  }\n  function move(dx, dy, repeat = false) {\n    if (locked() || !map) return;\n    const now = Date.now(); if (repeat && now - lastMove < 120) return; lastMove = now;\n    walkEpoch++; const next = G.move(map, position, dx, dy); syncPosition(next.position);\n    // NPCs wait for confirmation; walking through a doorway uses the existing travel action.\n    if (next.entity?.kind === 'exit') void interact(next.entity);\n  }\n  async function goTo(x, y, entity) {\n    if (locked() || !map) return;\n    const ticket = ++walkEpoch, scope = context.scope;\n    const route = G.reachable(map, position, { x, y, entity: !!entity });\n    if (!route) { notice('这里暂时走不到。'); return; }\n    for (const [dx, dy] of route) {\n      if (ticket !== walkEpoch || scope !== context.scope || locked()) return;\n      syncPosition(G.move(map, position, dx, dy).position);\n      if (document.documentElement.dataset.motion !== 'reduced') await new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, 100));\n    }\n    if (ticket === walkEpoch && scope === context.scope && !locked() && entity) {\n      syncPosition({ ...position, facing: [entity.x - position.x, entity.y - position.y] });\n      await interact(entity);\n    }\n  }\n  async function generate() {\n    if (locked() || generating || !context.scene || context.capabilities?.analysis?.available === false) return;\n    const ticket = ++generationEpoch, scope = context.scope, key = attemptKey();\n    attempted.add(key); generating = true; render();\n    const current = () => ticket === generationEpoch && scope === context.scope && context.scene && key === attemptKey() && !unavailable();\n    try {\n      await Eidos.files.write('chinese-room/map-request.json', G.generationMaterial(context, map, position, context.settings?.map_style));\n      if (!current()) return;\n      const result = await Eidos.resources.inspect('chinese-room/map-request.json', G.generationTask);\n      if (!current()) return;\n      const generated = G.validateMap(result.content, context.scene, position);\n      walkEpoch++; map = generated;\n      const { placeholder: _placeholder, entryFrom: _entryFrom, ...saved } = local.maps[map.sceneId] ?? {};\n      local.maps[map.sceneId] = { ...saved, layout: map, generated: signature(context.scene) }; save();\n    } catch (error) {\n      if (current()) notice(`地图暂未更新，仍可继续探索。${error instanceof SyntaxError ? '模型未返回有效地图。' : error.message}`);\n    } finally { if (ticket === generationEpoch) { generating = false; render(); } }\n  }\n  async function readMapFile(file, id, current) {\n    if (fileCache.has(id)) return fileCache.get(id);\n    const result = await Eidos.world.files.read(file.path, file.version);\n    if (!current()) return null;\n    if (result.version !== file.version) throw new Error('地图文件版本已变化');\n    const candidate = G.parseJSON(result.text);\n    fileScenes.set(id, candidate?.sceneId);\n    // Retain only the pending layout, not every historical file's full text.\n    fileCache.clear(); fileCache.set(id, candidate);\n    return candidate;\n  }\n  function adoptMapFile(candidate, scene, id) {\n    const starting = local.maps[scene.id]?.placeholder === true;\n    const next = G.validateMap(candidate, context.scene ?? scene, starting ? undefined : position);\n    walkEpoch++; map = next;\n    if (starting) position = local.maps[scene.id]?.entryFrom ? G.arrival(map, local.maps[scene.id].entryFrom) : G.positionFor(map);\n    local.positions[scene.id] = position;\n    local.maps[scene.id] = { layout: map, generated: signature(context.scene ?? scene), sourceFile: id };\n    attempted.add(attemptKeyFor(scene)); fileCache.delete(id); save(); render();\n  }\n  // Only played, committed files are advertised by the host; no draft can change the map.\n  function syncMapFiles() {\n    const scene = context.scene ?? publicScene;\n    if (!scene || !map || context.world?.sceneId && scene.id !== context.world.sceneId || context.reading?.loading || context.reading?.paused || context.surface?.active === false) return;\n    const files = [...(context.sceneMapFiles ?? [])].reverse();\n    const key = JSON.stringify([context.scope, scene.id, context.reading?.complete, files]);\n    if (fileScan === key || !files.length) return;\n    fileScan = key;\n    const ticket = ++fileEpoch, scope = context.scope;\n    const current = () => ticket === fileEpoch && scope === context.scope && context.surface?.active !== false;\n    filePending = true; cancelGeneration();\n    void (async () => {\n      for (const file of files) {\n        const id = JSON.stringify([file.path, file.version]);\n        if (fileScenes.has(id) && fileScenes.get(id) !== scene.id) continue;\n        if (local.maps[scene.id]?.sourceFile === id || invalidFiles.has(id)) return;\n        try {\n          const candidate = await readMapFile(file, id, current);\n          if (!current()) return;\n          if (candidate?.sceneId !== scene.id) { fileCache.delete(id); continue; }\n          adoptMapFile(candidate, scene, id); return;\n        } catch (error) {\n          if (!current()) return;\n          // A new person/door may not be public until the response is read; retry with that scene then.\n          if (!context.reading?.complete) return;\n          if (!invalidFiles.has(id)) { invalidFiles.add(id); notice(`地图文件未采用，保留原图。${error.message}`); }\n          return;\n        }\n      }\n    })().finally(() => { if (current()) { filePending = false; maybeGenerate(); } });\n  }\n  function maybeGenerate() {\n    if (locked() || generating || filePending || !map || !context.scene || context.settings?.auto_map === false || attempted.has(attemptKey())) return;\n    if (local.maps[context.scene.id]?.generated !== signature(context.scene)) void generate();\n  }\n  window.addEventListener('keydown', event => {\n    if (event.defaultPrevented || event.isComposing || event.keyCode === 229 || event.ctrlKey || event.metaKey || event.altKey || event.shiftKey || event.target?.closest?.('input,textarea,select,[contenteditable]:not([contenteditable=\"false\"]),[role=\"dialog\"]')) return;\n    const key = event.key.length === 1 ? event.key.toLowerCase() : event.key;\n    const bindings = context?.keyboardShortcuts;\n    const reserved = bindings && Object.entries(bindings).find(([, binding]) => binding && binding === key)?.[0];\n    if (reserved && (reserved !== 'advance' || event.repeat)) return;\n    const confirm = Eidos.keyboard?.matches ? Eidos.keyboard.matches(event, 'advance')\n      : [' ', 'Enter', ...(bindings ? [bindings.advance].filter(Boolean) : ['z', 'e'])].includes(key);\n    const direction = { ArrowUp: [0, -1], w: [0, -1], ArrowDown: [0, 1], s: [0, 1], ArrowLeft: [-1, 0], a: [-1, 0], ArrowRight: [1, 0], d: [1, 0] }[key];\n    if (confirm) {\n      if (context?.reading?.inputBlocked) return;\n      if (['Enter', ' '].includes(key) && event.target?.closest?.('button[data-cell]')) return;\n      event.preventDefault();\n      if (event.repeat) return;\n      if (!context?.reading?.complete && !context?.reading?.error) { if (!context?.reading?.loading && !context?.reading?.paused) Eidos.advance(); return; }\n      if (locked() || !map || event.repeat) return;\n      const entity = G.near(map, position).find(e => e.x === position.x + position.facing[0] && e.y === position.y + position.facing[1]);\n      if (entity) void interact(entity);\n    } else if (direction && !locked()) { event.preventDefault(); move(...direction, event.repeat); }\n    else if (key === 'Escape') { walkEpoch++; cancelGeneration(); render(); }\n  });\n  window.addEventListener('resize', render);\n  Eidos.onContext(next => {\n    if (context && (context.scope !== next.scope || next.surface?.active === false || next.reading?.paused || next.reading?.loading)) { walkEpoch++; cancelGeneration(); fileEpoch++; filePending = false; fileScan = ''; }\n    if (context?.world?.id !== next.world?.id) { map = null; position = null; arrival = null; attempted = new Set(); publicScene = null; fileCache.clear(); fileScenes.clear(); invalidFiles.clear(); fileScan = ''; fileEpoch++; filePending = false; }\n    if (context?.settings?.auto_map === false && next.settings?.auto_map === true) attempted = new Set();\n    context = next;\n    if (next.scene) publicScene = next.scene;\n    local = { maps: G.clone(next.state?.maps ?? {}), positions: G.clone(next.state?.positions ?? {}) };\n    if (!map && next.world?.sceneId && local.maps[next.world.sceneId]?.layout) {\n      const saved = local.maps[next.world.sceneId].layout;\n      try {\n        // Reopen the already saved picture while dialogue is unfinished; actual bindings reconcile later.\n        const refs = kind => saved.entities.filter(entity => entity.kind === kind).map(entity => ({ id: entity.ref, name: entity.name }));\n        map = G.validateMap(saved, { id: next.world.sceneId, npcs: refs('npc'), exits: refs('exit'), objects: refs('object'), actions: refs('action').map(entity => entity.id) });\n        position = G.positionFor(map, local.positions[next.world.sceneId]);\n      } catch (error) { map = null; position = null; console.warn('暂存地图未能恢复，将按公开场景重建', error); }\n    }\n    if (next.scene && !next.reading?.loading && !next.reading?.paused) {\n      const saved = local.maps[next.scene.id], previous = saved?.layout;\n      position = local.positions[next.scene.id] ?? null;\n      map = previous ? G.reconcile(previous, next.scene, position) : G.baseMap(next.scene); position =